# AI Studio exports the workspace into an `aistudio/` folder wherever it runs.
# The bare name (not the root-anchored `.aistudio/`) also catches the copies
# that land under `public/`, where they would otherwise be served as site assets.
aistudio/
.aistudio/
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# Local agent memory (not part of the product)
.openhands/
# Vercel CLI project link (created by `vercel link`)
.vercel

# The package manager is bun (`bun.lock`); `npm install`/`npm ci` are not used
# and `npm ci` fails against `bun.lock` (see AGENTS.md). A committed
# `package-lock.json` was a second, stale manifest that drifted from
# `package.json` and was the only lockfile Dependabot audited. Dependabot now
# watches the real `bun.lock` (`.github/dependabot.yml`), so keep npm's lockfile
# out of the tree.
package-lock.json
